id: full-force-super-saiyan-2-sparking-limit-break
name: Sparking Limit Break
order: 1
slot: trait
description: >
  Pushing past the limits of Super Saiyan 2, clad in arcs of lightning, your power skyrockets even further beyond.
text: >
  Sparking Limit Break: Pushing past the limits of Super Saiyan 2, clad in arcs of lightning, your power skyrockets even further beyond.
  (1)-[Passive]: Your Attacking Maneuvers that possess a Ki Wager equal to or exceeding 1/4 of your Max Capacity have their Strike Rolls increased by 1(T).
  (2)-[Passive]: Your Attacking Maneuvers that possess a Ki Wager equal to or exceeding 1/4 of your Max Capacity have their Wound Rolls increased by 4(T).
  (3)-[Triggered/Power, 1/Round]: Spend 4(bT) Ki Points to enter the Surging State until the end of your turn.
  (4)-[Triggered, 1/Encounter]: If you would gain any number of stacks of the Fatigued Combat Condition, you may instead regain Ki Points equal to 1/2 of your Surgency.
  (5)-[Triggered/Start of Turn, 1/Encounter]: If no other Character has taken their turn yet during this Combat Round, you may enter the Superior State for the duration of that turn.

---

# (1), (2) A Ki Wager of 1/4 of your Max Capacity or more: Strike 1(T), Wound 4(T) (chat.mjs strikeParts, woundParts).
[passive, effect 1]
strike.heavyWager += 1(T);

[passive, effect 2]
wound.heavyWager += 4(T);

# (3) With the Power Up, once a Round: 4(bT) Ki Points for Surging till the end of your turn.
[triggered/power, 1/round, effect 3]
requires ki.value >= 4(bT);
ki.value -= 4(bT);
enterState(surging, 1, turn);

# (4) Fatigued gained for Ki instead: the table's.

# (5) At the start of your turn, no other Character having taken theirs this Round, once an Encounter: the Superior State for it - "no
# other first" the table's to say.
[triggered/start-of-turn, 1/encounter, effect 5]
enterState(superior, 1, turn);
